- 官方文档：https://help.getzep.com/graphiti/core-concepts/adding-episodes.md ；https://help.getzep.com/how-graph-creation-works.md ；https://help.getzep.com/adding-batch-data.md （Batch API：单批 50,000 条、每次 `batch.add` ≤350、`strict_ontology`）；https://help.getzep.com/zep-ingest.md ；https://help.getzep.com/prepare-data-for-ingestion.md （episode ≤10,000 字符、消息 4,096 字符）；https://help.getzep.com/facts.md
- 论文：https://arxiv.org/abs/2501.13956 （双时间四戳、`t_invalid = t_valid(新边)`、前文 n=4；论文的 reflexion 步骤在当前源码中已不存在）
- Neo4j：https://neo4j.com/docs/neo4j-graphrag-python/current/user_guide_kg_builder.html ；https://github.com/neo4j/neo4j-graphrag-python （`src/neo4j_graphrag/experimental/pipeline/config/template_pipeline/simple_kg_builder.py`、`src/neo4j_graphrag/components/{resolver.py,graph_pruning.py,entity_relation_extractor.py}`）；https://pypi.org/project/neo4j-graphrag/

